{"seq":6,"slug":"controversies-and-appraisal","title":"丹尼尔·卡尼曼·争议与评价","stage":"DONE","category":"daniel-kahneman","categoryLabel":"丹尼尔·卡尼曼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/controversies-and-appraisal","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/07_daniel-kahneman/6_controversies-and-appraisal","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"争议与评价\">争议与评价</h1><p>本卷以辩证的眼光审视围绕丹尼尔·卡尼曼（1934–2024）的争议，并对其做出综合评价。它不复述卡尼曼&quot;做了什么&quot;，而是追问&quot;这些工作有多可靠、引发了哪些争论、最终该如何评判他&quot;——是整个卡尼曼 hub 系列的<strong>批判性收束</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷的分工\">本卷 vs. 兄弟卷的分工</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他是谁、经历了什么</td>\n<td>提供人物背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>启发法、前景理论、双系统是什么</td>\n<td>本卷争议的<strong>对象</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他如何思考与研究</td>\n<td>理解批评的前提</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a></td>\n<td>《思考，快与慢》等</td>\n<td>第 4 章争议的来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>他改变了什么</td>\n<td>本卷&quot;肯定&quot;的实证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>争议与评价（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>他的工作有多可靠、该如何评判</strong></td>\n<td><strong>批判性收束</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：前五卷讲&quot;成就&quot;，本卷讲&quot;对成就的可靠性审视与最终评判&quot;。本卷不重复讲解前景理论或双系统的内容，只在需要时以相对路径链接回 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>阅读本卷前，建议先掌握 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>（尤其 <a href=\"../core-contributions/heuristics-and-biases/\">启发法与偏误</a> 与 <a href=\"../core-contributions/prospect-theory/\">前景理论</a>），否则&quot;窄规范批评&quot;&quot;损失厌恶被夸大&quot;等争议将难以理解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    R1[1.可重复性危机&lt;br/&gt;质疑+回应] --&gt; R2[2.思想争论&lt;br/&gt;启发法批评+理性之争]&#10;    R2 --&gt; R3[3.综合评价&lt;br/&gt;先驱定位+全面评判]&#10;    R3 -.回链.-&gt; CC[核心贡献]&#10;    R3 -.回链.-&gt; LEG[影响与遗产]\">graph LR\n    R1[1.可重复性危机&lt;br/&gt;质疑+回应] --&gt; R2[2.思想争论&lt;br/&gt;启发法批评+理性之争]\n    R2 --&gt; R3[3.综合评价&lt;br/&gt;先驱定位+全面评判]\n    R3 -.回链.-&gt; CC[核心贡献]\n    R3 -.回链.-&gt; LEG[影响与遗产]</pre><ol>\n<li><strong>可重复性危机</strong>：先看 <a href=\"the-replication-crisis/replication-issues\">可重复性的质疑</a>（OSC 2015、第 4 章 R-Index=14），再看 <a href=\"the-replication-crisis/kahnemans-response\">卡尼曼的回应</a>（2012 预警、2017 认错）。</li>\n<li><strong>思想的争论</strong>：<a href=\"debates/critiques-of-heuristics\">对启发法理论的批评</a>（吉仁泽的窄规范）通向 <a href=\"debates/rationality-debate\">理性之争</a>（有限理性）。</li>\n<li><strong>综合评价</strong>：<a href=\"overall-appraisal/pioneer-of-the-mind\">心智科学的先驱</a> 给出肯定一极，<a href=\"overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment\">全面的评判</a> 做最终辩证综合。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"本卷三章一览\">本卷三章一览</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章·可重复性危机</strong>：危机的范围与边界——核心理论（前景理论）稳，外围引用（社会启动）伤；以及卡尼曼堪为典范的回应。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章·思想的争论</strong>：吉仁泽学派对启发法纲领的方法论批评，及其上升为&quot;人类是否理性&quot;的哲学争论。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章·综合评价</strong>：以&quot;杰出而真实的伟人&quot;为结论，既不神化也不贬低。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读完本卷，建议回到 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a> 体会这些争议如何并未削弱、反而印证了卡尼曼的历史分量。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-replication-crisis","title":"可重复性危机","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/controversies-and-appraisal/the-replication-crisis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"replication-issues","title":"可重复性的质疑","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/controversies-and-appraisal/the-replication-crisis/replication-issues"},{"seq":2,"slug":"kahnemans-response","title":"卡尼曼的回应","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/controversies-and-appraisal/the-replication-crisis/kahnemans-response"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"debates","title":"思想的争论","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/controversies-and-appraisal/debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"critiques-of-heuristics","title":"对启发法理论的批评","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/critiques-of-heuristics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rationality-debate","title":"理性之争","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/rationality-debate"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"综合评价","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pioneer-of-the-mind","title":"心智科学的先驱","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/pioneer-of-the-mind"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment"}]}]}